-ngór ti-hiâ toa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">是<rt class=\"tli-rt\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">掌上明珠<rt class=\"tli-rt\">쟝ˆ셩뼹주ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">抱<rt class=\"tli-rt\">포ˉ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">金金看<rt class=\"tli-rt\">김ˉ김ˉ콸</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì si-gùn’e jiâng-siong-bieng-jû, phō’tio kīm-kīm-khoa̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">看<rt class=\"tli-rt\">콸ˋ</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">度晬<rt class=\"tli-rt\">더제</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">看<rt class=\"tli-rt\">콸ˋ</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">收瀾<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슈ˉ놔ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">看<rt class=\"tli-rt\">콸ˋ</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">咧<rt class=\"tli-rt\">렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">學<rt class=\"tli-rt\">옿-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">行<rt class=\"tli-rt\">걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khoà̰-lì tor-je, khoà̰-lì siū-noā, khoà̰-lì lêh-oh-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">看<rt class=\"tli-rt\">콸ˋ</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">會<rt class=\"tli-rt\">에-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">走<rt class=\"tli-rt\">ᄌᅷˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">看<rt class=\"tli-rt\">콸ˋ</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">出世<rt class=\"tli-rt\">춛ˆ시</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">相片<rt class=\"tli-rt\">셩ˋ필</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">一<rt class=\"tli-rt\">짇-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">大<rt class=\"tli-rt\">돠-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">疊<rt class=\"tli-rt\">탛ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khoà̰-lì e-jàu, khoà̰-lì chût-si, siòng-phḭ jit-toa-thâh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">輕輕<rt class=\"tli-rt\">킨ˉ킨ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">聽<rt class=\"tli-rt\">턀ˆ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">喘氣<rt class=\"tli-rt\">촨ˆ퀴ˋ</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">聲<rt class=\"tli-rt\">샬ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">心肝<rt class=\"tli-rt\">심ˉ괄ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">寶貝<rt class=\"tli-rt\">보ˆ붸ˋ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">囝<rt class=\"tli-rt\">걀ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khīn-khīn-thiâ̰’tio choân-khùi-siâ̰, sīm-koā̰-pô-puè-kià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">是<rt class=\"tli-rt\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">幸福<rt class=\"tli-rt\">혱헉</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">希望<rt class=\"tli-rt\">히ˉ빵ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">斟酌<rt class=\"tli-rt\">짐ˉ젹ˆ-</rt></ruby>가<ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">晟<rt class=\"tli-rt\">챨ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì si-gùn’e hieng-hork hī-bāng, jīm-jiôrk-ka-lî-chiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">望<rt class=\"tli-rt\">빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">精光<rt class=\"tli-rt\">졩ˉ겅ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">望<rt class=\"tli-rt\">빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">知情<rt class=\"tli-rt\">재ˉ쟐ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">望<rt class=\"tli-rt\">빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">趕緊<rt class=\"tli-rt\">괄ˆ긴ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">大<rt class=\"tli-rt\">돠ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bang-lì jiēng-kông, bang-lì jāi-jiá̰, bang-lì koâ̰-kîn-toā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">望<rt class=\"tli-rt\">빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">古錐<rt class=\"tli-rt\">거ˆ쥐ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">健康<rt class=\"tli-rt\">곈컹ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">活潑<rt class=\"tli-rt\">왛퐏</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">毋驚<rt class=\"tli-rt\">음걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">受<rt class=\"tli-rt\">슈-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">風<rt class=\"tli-rt\">헝ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">寒<rt class=\"tli-rt\">괄ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bang-lì kôr-jûi, kien-khōng-oah-phoat, m-kiā̰-siu-hōng-koá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">鳥仔<rt class=\"tli-rt\">ᄌᆤˆ아ˋ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">風吹<rt class=\"tli-rt\">헝ˉ췌ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby class=\"tli-reading-ruby\">攏總<rt class=\"t